---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Rosette from '../components/Rosette.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/format';
---

<Base
  title="How ordering works"
  description="How to order from As-Subkī Books: request your titles, we hold them for 48 hours, and payment is arranged directly."
>
  <div class="py-10 md:py-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[34px] md:text-[40px] font-semibold leading-tight">
      A bookshop that runs on conversation
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
        As-Subkī Books brings together classical Arabic texts, the Dars Nizami and Maktab syllabus,
        hadith, fiqh, tafsir and children's readers. Much of what we carry is difficult to find on
        the high street and expensive to import one copy at a time, so we buy in quantity and pass
        the price on.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="my-10 flex justify-center text-[var(--color-wash)]">
      <Rosette size={44} />
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-center font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[24px] font-semibold">
      Ordering, step by step
    </h2>
    <ol class="mt-5 space-y-6">
      <li>
        <h3 class="text-[17px]">1. Build your basket</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
          Browse or search the catalogue and add what you need. Stock counts on the site are live.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="text-[17px]">2. Send your request</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
          Give us your name, email and whether you want delivery or collection. You will get an
          itemised confirmation straight away with a reference number such as ASB-4F7K.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="text-[17px]">3. Your books are held for 48 hours</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
          Nobody else can request the same copies while we reply. If we do not hear back within two
          days the hold lapses and the books return to the shelf - nothing is charged and there is
          nothing to cancel.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="text-[17px]">4. We send payment details</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
          We reply with the total including postage and how to pay. Once payment clears we post the
          books and confirm by email.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-center font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[24px] font-semibold">
      Looking for something we do not list?
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[15.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
      Ask. We can often source a title, and new stock is announced on our Telegram channel first.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href={SITE.telegram} rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Telegram channel</a>
      <a href="https://assubkibooks.co.uk/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Contact the shop</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
